  "result": "I fixed the cross-organization leak in `findIssueById` in `src/server/repositories/issue-repository.ts`. I haven't run the test suite.\n\nThe function took an `orgId` but only filtered on the issue id, so an id from another organization returned that organization's issue. It now filters on both the organization and the id, so a foreign id returns `null` and the app treats the issue as not found.\n\nThe other by-id queries in the same file (lines 414–475) already filter on the organization. I didn't check the label, comment, or attachment repositories for the same gap.",
